{
    "title": "Once: Find your Perfect Match",
    "description": "Discover Mindful Dating with Once \r\n\r\nLooking for your perfect match without the hassle of endless swiping? Looking for an app for mindful dating and chat? Look no further than Once dating app! \r\n\r\nOnce is all about mindful dating and genuine connections. We bring you one perfect match every day, someone who shares your interests and vibe, making it easier than ever to meet your soulmate, date, and find love.\r\n\r\nWhy You\u2019ll Love Once\r\n\r\nOnce gives you the flexibility to choose how you match, meet, chat, and date. Whether you prefer serious dating and chat, meeting people through instant matchups, or a mix of both, we've got you covered. Here are the top features you'll fall in love with:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9e PERFECT MATCH: Meet and chat with one special person every day who shares mutual vibes with you. Let this classic Once soulmate finder feature delve deeper to spark true love!\r\n\ud83d\ude0d PUR PUR CARDS GAME: Break the ice with this fun game in each chat. Answer random questions, some basic and some spicy, to get closer with your match. It\u2019s great for meaningful conversations and you\u2019ll never run out of topics!\r\n\ud83d\udc8c MUSIC MATCH: Find your perfect match based on shared music tastes. Link your Spotify account, and our algorithm will match you with potential partners who share your musical interests.\r\n\r\nReady to Mingle and Find Love? \r\n\r\nEnjoy these FREE real dating and chat features:\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0f 1 Perfect Match per day\r\n\u2764\ufe0f 1 boost after registration\r\n\u2764\ufe0f 10 likes a day\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Starting 5 chats before the first message from your partner\r\n\u2764\ufe0f 50 Gems to unlock special perks\r\n\r\nUnlock More with Our Subscription:\r\n\r\n\u270c\ufe0f 3 Perfect Matches per day (instead of 1)\r\n\u270c\ufe0f Unlimited likes\r\n\u270c\ufe0f Unlimited messages\r\n\u270c\ufe0f View who liked you\r\n\u270c\ufe0f View your visitors\r\n\u270c\ufe0f Sending and viewing of photos and Pur Pur Cards in a chat \r\n\u270c\ufe0f 45 Gems when purchasing and renewing a subscription\r\n\u270c\ufe0f10 Gems daily when logging in\r\n\u270c\ufe0f1 Boost daily when logging in\r\n\u270c\ufe0f View the read statuses \r\n\u270c\ufe0fBrowse music taste matches on Spotify\r\n\r\nGems Give You Even More:\r\n\r\n- Send messages, photos, and Pur Pur Cards.\r\n- View photos and Pur Pur Cards\r\n- Send gifts to anyone\r\n- Buy a boost\r\n\r\nJoin Over 30 Million Singles Worldwide\r\n\r\nWith over 30 million singles ready for dating and chat, backed by over 25 years of experience, Once is one of the most popular dating apps. Whether you're looking to talk to girls, meet women and men, or dive into a pure dating experience, Once is your go-to for love, romance, and companionship. Find your perfect match with our dating and chat app.\r\n\r\nNeed Help?\r\n\r\nGot feedback or need assistance? Reach out to our team at support@getonce.com. We're here to help!\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://www.getonce.com/policy/?mobile=true\r\nTerms and conditions: https://www.getonce.com/terms-and-conditions/?mobile=true\r\n\r\nDiscover the joy of mindful dating with Once dating and chat app. Start dating and chat to find your soulmate. Download now and meet your perfect match today!",
